      "where": "free text inside rectangle g92040",
      "budget_px": 442,
      "budget_chars_per_line": 61
    },
    {
      "id": "g92076",
      "text": "The load-bearing step  —  read the diff like an author",
      "translation": "Несущий шаг  —  читайте дифф как автор",
      "where": "free text inside rectangle g92073",
      "budget_px": 857,
      "budget_chars_per_line": 89
    },
    {
      "id": "g92079",
      "text": "· reconstruct why each choice was made, not just that the lines parse",
      "translation": "· восстановите, почему сделан каждый выбор, а не только что код парсится",
      "where": "free text inside rectangle g92073",
      "budget_px": 857,
      "budget_chars_per_line": 109
    },
    {
      "id": "g92082",
      "text": "· trace one path the tests don't cover — ask whether the design would survive it",
